WEBVTT

00:00:16.560 --> 00:00:20.520
Look, the sky up above has begun to move.
Hora miageta sora ugokidashita yo

00:00:20.520 --> 00:00:23.750
Your astonishment was so dazzling.
Odoroku kimi mabushikute

00:00:23.750 --> 00:00:27.810
Should I forgive the lies you told me yesterday
Kinou tsuita uso mo yurusou kana

00:00:27.810 --> 00:00:31.090
just because the morning light is so pretty?
Kesa no hikari kirei dakara

00:00:31.090 --> 00:00:38.170
The sound of your laughter is always important to me
Kimi no warai goe itsu datte daiji da yo

00:00:38.170 --> 00:00:41.820
because it gives me courage.
Yuuki kureru kara saa

00:00:41.820 --> 00:00:43.720
It's not a lie.
Uso ja nai

00:00:43.720 --> 00:00:46.460
It's a beauty really
It's a beauty really

00:00:47.310 --> 00:00:49.610
Your voice whenever.

00:00:49.610 --> 00:00:50.990
It makes me have.

00:00:50.990 --> 00:00:51.660
Even the silliest things sound dear,
Sasai na koto mo itoshiku hibiku yo

00:00:51.660 --> 00:00:57.980
Sasai na koto mo itoshiku hibiku yo
Even the silliest things sound dear,

00:00:57.980 --> 00:01:01.540
if it's your voice I hear.
kimi no koe nara

00:01:01.540 --> 00:01:03.810
You're sad whenever.

00:01:03.810 --> 00:01:05.500
It takes you back.

00:01:05.500 --> 00:01:08.840
My heart runneth over.
Hamidasu kokoro

00:01:08.840 --> 00:01:16.040
Unable to control myself, I set off at a run.
Osaerarenakute hashiri dashita yo

00:01:16.050 --> 00:01:19.100
I can forever.

00:01:38.390 --> 00:01:39.600
Ah, the bell's ringing.

00:01:39.600 --> 00:01:41.650
Let's get to class.

00:01:41.650 --> 00:01:42.830
How the time does fly.

00:01:42.830 --> 00:01:46.630
As long as you're around, I can make good progress on my studies.

00:01:46.630 --> 00:01:48.510
Here, Manaka-kun.

00:01:48.870 --> 00:01:49.630
What's this?

00:01:50.610 --> 00:01:51.620
Umm,

00:01:51.920 --> 00:01:56.150
I made a list of kanji that might appear on the test.

00:01:56.150 --> 00:01:58.600
There's not much time before the test,

00:01:59.130 --> 00:02:02.410
and I hoped it would help you study at home.

00:02:02.410 --> 00:02:04.210
Am I meddling here?

00:02:04.210 --> 00:02:06.640
No, this is great, thanks.

00:02:07.200 --> 00:02:10.310
O-Okay, then I'll go on ahead to class.

00:02:14.620 --> 00:02:16.400
Wow, it's hand-written...

00:02:17.170 --> 00:02:19.860
She'd go this far for me...?

00:02:22.090 --> 00:02:23.760
This is so awesome!

00:02:24.300 --> 00:02:26.410
Toujou is a good person.

00:02:26.910 --> 00:02:30.410
She has her own tests, yet she took time out for my sake.

00:02:31.310 --> 00:02:35.240
She helps me study, makes printouts,

00:02:35.920 --> 00:02:38.420
and is writing a novel that has me on the edge of my seat...

00:02:38.680 --> 00:02:42.300
I really like the time we spend together!

00:02:43.190 --> 00:02:45.010
W-What am I saying?

00:02:45.010 --> 00:02:47.430
I'm supposed to be
going out with Nishino.

00:02:47.430 --> 00:02:51.600
No, that's not it, Nishino!
I never said I like Toujou.

00:02:52.700 --> 00:02:54.770
Err, why am I getting
so flustered over this?

00:02:56.520 --> 00:03:01.520
Study Session of Wavering Love

00:03:03.170 --> 00:03:04.670
Junpei-kun.

00:03:05.750 --> 00:03:08.830
Hey, I'm leaving. Hurry up!

00:03:09.340 --> 00:03:11.830
Sorry, Nishino. Be right there.

00:03:19.690 --> 00:03:22.240
Junpei-kun, are you making progress with your studies?

00:03:22.240 --> 00:03:23.400
Yeah,

00:03:23.400 --> 00:03:26.380
I'm trying my best so that we can go to Izumizaka together.

00:03:26.690 --> 00:03:31.010
Also, I've been getting up early
so that Toujou can tutor me.

00:03:31.010 --> 00:03:32.030
"Toujou"?

00:03:32.740 --> 00:03:33.850
Who's this "Toujou"?

00:03:33.850 --> 00:03:35.290
Erm, that is...

00:03:36.330 --> 00:03:37.410
Uhh...

00:03:40.890 --> 00:03:41.700
Toujou.

00:03:44.180 --> 00:03:45.440
Manaka-kun.

00:03:45.440 --> 00:03:46.770
Got a moment?

00:03:47.560 --> 00:03:48.620
Nishino is...

00:03:57.590 --> 00:03:59.570
Thank you, Toujou-san.

00:03:59.790 --> 00:04:01.710
If it's something I understand...

00:04:02.050 --> 00:04:03.020
I'm so happy.

00:04:03.020 --> 00:04:04.910
Man, Junpei-kun,

00:04:04.910 --> 00:04:08.480
you've been studying with Toujou-san, who's ranked #1 in our year.

00:04:08.480 --> 00:04:11.380
You should've told me sooner.

00:04:13.910 --> 00:04:15.390
So, Toujou-san...

00:04:15.690 --> 00:04:20.030
I don't get this linear equation application problem at all.

00:04:20.030 --> 00:04:22.520
Application of a linear equation? Let's see...

00:04:22.520 --> 00:04:24.980
Yeah, like this one.

00:04:24.980 --> 00:04:25.410
This one?

00:04:26.280 --> 00:04:27.210
Yes, that one.

00:04:28.090 --> 00:04:29.420
Tell me, tell me.

00:04:29.420 --> 00:04:30.660
So, a problem like this...

00:04:31.140 --> 00:04:33.390
If you put this here,
it turns out this way, right?

00:04:34.400 --> 00:04:38.390
And then X becomes this,
and you get the answer.

00:04:39.170 --> 00:04:41.170
Ah! That's right. I see!

00:04:41.170 --> 00:04:43.270
I should make a note of that before I forget.

00:04:44.250 --> 00:04:46.540
You're incredible, Toujou-san.

00:04:46.540 --> 00:04:49.690
Your explanation's so much easier to understand than my teacher's.

00:04:49.990 --> 00:04:51.950
I wouldn't think so, but...

00:04:55.230 --> 00:04:57.270
Is there something on my face?

00:04:57.830 --> 00:05:01.500
Toujou-san, why do you always look like that?

00:05:01.500 --> 00:05:04.490
You're letting such a
pretty face go to waste.

00:05:06.000 --> 00:05:08.280
Don't you agree, Junpei-kun?

00:05:08.280 --> 00:05:10.510
Eh? Err, uhh, yeah.

00:05:10.760 --> 00:05:13.870
Hey, Toujou-san. Take off your glasses for a second.

00:05:13.870 --> 00:05:15.790
Ah, d-don't!

00:05:16.640 --> 00:05:19.730
If you did, you'd be really pretty.

00:05:20.440 --> 00:05:21.810
But, I--

00:05:21.810 --> 00:05:22.940
Junpei-kun?

00:05:25.550 --> 00:05:30.440
I think it's a bad idea to make her do something she doesn't want to.

00:05:32.110 --> 00:05:34.200
Really? What a crying shame.

00:05:34.530 --> 00:05:35.680
Well...

00:05:36.040 --> 00:05:38.260
How about lowering your bangs a bit?

00:05:38.670 --> 00:05:41.140
It'd really improve your image--

00:05:41.140 --> 00:05:42.330
Welcome!

00:05:45.710 --> 00:05:48.860
That guy wearing a muscle shirt in the middle of winter...

00:05:49.250 --> 00:05:50.870
It's the Lifestyle Guidance Counselor, Shiratori!

00:05:57.120 --> 00:06:00.890
This is bad. He's got the eyes of a hunter with prey in its sights.

00:06:00.890 --> 00:06:03.630
Let's make a run for it.
We'll be in big trouble if he finds us.

00:06:04.350 --> 00:06:06.940
You're right. Toujou-san, hurry up.

00:06:07.190 --> 00:06:10.480
We don't want a "buying sweets" offense on our permanent records, do we?

00:06:10.860 --> 00:06:14.140
But we can't leave without passing by the teacher.

00:06:15.640 --> 00:06:17.640
What should we do? Oh, I know!

00:06:17.940 --> 00:06:19.640
That door's a back door, isn't it?

00:06:19.940 --> 00:06:21.200
Let's use it to escape.

00:06:21.610 --> 00:06:22.910
Mi-Midori-san...

00:06:23.480 --> 00:06:26.620
Good afternoon. Nice weather we're having, huh?

00:06:26.620 --> 00:06:29.400
Ten of the usual, please.

00:06:29.400 --> 00:06:32.580
Looks like Shiratori-sensei's only here to eat doughnuts.

00:06:32.580 --> 00:06:36.180
Actually, I think he has a thing for that cashier.

00:06:41.280 --> 00:06:44.560
All right, we'll go out all at once so we don't get caught.

00:06:48.760 --> 00:06:50.710
You call this a back door?!

00:06:50.710 --> 00:06:53.380
This is just a broom closet.

00:06:53.780 --> 00:06:55.560
L-Let's leave.

00:06:55.560 --> 00:06:58.480
But if we leave now,
Shiratori will find us.

00:06:58.910 --> 00:07:02.490
Wait, Junpei-kun, where are you touching?

00:07:02.490 --> 00:07:05.770
A-Ah sorry, but my hand is caught.

00:07:07.040 --> 00:07:09.250
Don't touch me there.

00:07:09.250 --> 00:07:10.920
Uhh, sorry.

00:07:11.420 --> 00:07:14.530
Jeez, quit moving around, Junpei-kun!

00:07:17.260 --> 00:07:20.450
Manaka-kun, don't move your hand.

00:07:20.450 --> 00:07:22.430
I-It wasn't on purpose.

00:07:25.310 --> 00:07:30.580
I'm squished between two soft, sweet-smelling girls...

00:07:30.580 --> 00:07:33.760
Just how long am I going to have to endure this?!

00:07:35.090 --> 00:07:36.820
Thank you very much!

00:07:37.860 --> 00:07:39.870
See you tomorrow.

00:07:41.240 --> 00:07:44.130
It must be annoying to have that stalker come in here every day.

00:07:44.130 --> 00:07:45.330
Tell me about it.

00:07:49.110 --> 00:07:51.270
I'm really tired.

00:07:51.270 --> 00:07:52.420
Me too.

00:07:52.420 --> 00:07:53.450
But...

00:07:54.020 --> 00:07:58.800
it was kind of fun and exciting to hide in a small place, as if we were kids again.

00:08:01.140 --> 00:08:04.450
Did I... say something strange?

00:08:04.870 --> 00:08:10.750
No, it's just that you really <i>do</i> look cute with your bangs down, Toujou-san.

00:08:11.140 --> 00:08:13.950
Junpei-kun, don't you think so too?

00:08:14.760 --> 00:08:17.260
Yeah, that look's so much better.

00:08:18.200 --> 00:08:19.710
But in the end,

00:08:19.710 --> 00:08:22.510
I wasn't able to learn much math.

00:08:22.860 --> 00:08:25.200
If only Shiratori hadn't
showed up back there...

00:08:25.200 --> 00:08:29.730
Why don't you join us in the library tomorrow morning to study?

00:08:31.150 --> 00:08:34.900
When it comes to studying,
two's company, three's a party!

00:08:34.900 --> 00:08:39.330
Sure, I'll have to go ahead and join in.

00:08:39.330 --> 00:08:41.240
I'll be in your care, Toujou-san.

00:08:41.240 --> 00:08:43.250
Y-Yeah.

00:08:47.920 --> 00:08:49.840
I heard, I heard.

00:08:53.590 --> 00:08:56.170
From now on, I'll be studying with
Nishino early in the morning.

00:08:57.030 --> 00:08:58.710
Oh. Good morning, Manaka-kun.

00:09:01.170 --> 00:09:01.970
What?

00:09:01.970 --> 00:09:03.010
N-Nothing.

00:09:03.010 --> 00:09:04.120
Good morning!

00:09:05.280 --> 00:09:08.070
Ah Toujou-san, you look so cute!

00:09:08.720 --> 00:09:12.320
I know that might be just flattery, but I'm still embarrassed.

00:09:12.320 --> 00:09:15.380
It's not flattery; that really is a good look for you.

00:09:15.700 --> 00:09:16.990
Library

00:09:17.500 --> 00:09:18.490
What?

00:09:18.960 --> 00:09:21.990
Yo! You guys here to study too?

00:09:21.990 --> 00:09:23.820
What a conscience!

00:09:23.820 --> 00:09:25.970
Don't you mean "coincidence"?
What're you doing here, anyway?

00:09:25.970 --> 00:09:27.960
Tsukasa-chan! Good morning.

00:09:30.260 --> 00:09:31.790
I tried to stop him, but...

00:09:31.790 --> 00:09:36.570
It's Komiyama's last chance to get Nishino's attention, so he insisted.

00:09:36.570 --> 00:09:37.670
Gaah...

00:09:38.010 --> 00:09:39.960
Beautiful as always.

00:09:47.030 --> 00:09:49.480
Is there something
you don't understand?

00:09:50.060 --> 00:09:51.160
Komiyama-kun?

00:09:51.580 --> 00:09:56.280
There's something different about you today.

00:09:56.280 --> 00:09:56.950
Really?

00:09:57.390 --> 00:10:00.300
Oh, that's it. It's your hairstyle.

00:10:00.720 --> 00:10:02.550
Your hair style changed.

00:10:02.550 --> 00:10:04.840
It looks good, it fits you.

00:10:04.840 --> 00:10:08.110
It's cute. You should wear it like that all the time.

00:10:08.110 --> 00:10:09.350
T-Thank you.

00:10:12.990 --> 00:10:15.210
Hey, let's get back to studying, Komiyama!

00:10:15.210 --> 00:10:16.670
O-Okay.

00:10:18.470 --> 00:10:19.520
Ah, sorry.

00:10:25.720 --> 00:10:26.550
Eh?

00:10:27.810 --> 00:10:28.980
Komiyama-kun!?

00:10:29.540 --> 00:10:30.580
Komiyama?

00:10:30.580 --> 00:10:32.190
What the heck happened?

00:10:35.320 --> 00:10:36.380
So good!

00:10:36.940 --> 00:10:40.150
Toujou Aya-chan is the best!

00:10:40.150 --> 00:10:44.310
The best. The best. The best...

00:10:44.310 --> 00:10:47.960
Unless you calm down,
the bleeding won't stop.

00:10:49.160 --> 00:10:52.970
They were soft. They were soft~

00:10:52.970 --> 00:10:54.540
My first time~

00:10:56.840 --> 00:10:59.610
First Nishino, and now Toujou?

00:10:59.610 --> 00:11:02.890
He's always falling for girls who're way out of his league.

00:11:03.510 --> 00:11:06.600
I don't think you can say for sure that she's out of his league.

00:11:07.030 --> 00:11:09.110
I mean, Toujou doesn't
have a boyfriend.

00:11:09.110 --> 00:11:11.770
She might not have a boyfriend,

00:11:11.770 --> 00:11:15.230
but if she likes someone else,
he doesn't have much hope.

00:11:15.230 --> 00:11:17.580
What? Someone she likes?

00:11:17.580 --> 00:11:19.840
Was there anyone that Toujou likes?

00:11:20.530 --> 00:11:22.390
What are you saying?

00:11:22.390 --> 00:11:26.450
No matter how you look at it,
Toujou likes <i>you.</i>

00:11:28.390 --> 00:11:32.310
Toujou... likes me?

00:11:34.870 --> 00:11:36.670
But, I...

00:11:57.120 --> 00:12:00.030
Before I knew it,
that day had arrived.

00:12:03.520 --> 00:12:05.580
Pork cutlets first thing in the morning?

00:12:05.580 --> 00:12:08.450
That's right, and lunch will also be pork cutlets.

00:12:09.020 --> 00:12:10.840
You're having pork cutlets
for dinner, too.

00:12:11.270 --> 00:12:15.210
I might make lucky pork cutlets until we hear that you passed.

00:12:15.730 --> 00:12:19.700
Nothing against pork cutlets, but I wouldn't want to eat them every day...

00:12:19.700 --> 00:12:22.540
Start with putting on your right shoe, your right.

00:12:22.540 --> 00:12:25.870
That's the Manaka family ancestral tradition.

00:12:26.970 --> 00:12:28.720
I'll be fine!

00:12:30.090 --> 00:12:35.190
Yes, entrance exam day at my first choice -- Izumizaka High School.

00:12:38.200 --> 00:12:42.760
We've done so much studying to get in here, haven't we?

00:12:43.280 --> 00:12:45.380
Let's try our best, Junpei-kun.

00:12:45.380 --> 00:12:47.560
Erm... <i>yeah.</i>

00:12:50.420 --> 00:12:53.190
Check out that girl!
She's pretty cute, isn't she?

00:12:54.440 --> 00:12:56.150
What could her name be?

00:12:59.030 --> 00:13:04.050
The Illusionary
Beautiful Girl Returns!

00:13:04.050 --> 00:13:06.430
Manaka Junpei
Nishino Tsukasa
On Cards: Examination Location

00:13:06.430 --> 00:13:09.600
Aww, I'm on the 3rd floor.

00:13:09.600 --> 00:13:12.800
You being in a different classroom makes me a little uneasy.

00:13:12.800 --> 00:13:16.990
We studied with <i>the</i> Toujou. We'll be okay.

00:13:17.600 --> 00:13:19.890
Then let's both do our best.

00:13:19.890 --> 00:13:20.770
Yeah.

00:13:22.840 --> 00:13:26.680
You're late, Manaka.
I was waiting for you.

00:13:26.680 --> 00:13:30.100
Komiyama, I hope you weren't going to ask me to help you cheat.

00:13:30.900 --> 00:13:34.670
Wrong, dumbass!
Look at the seat behind you.

00:13:36.130 --> 00:13:38.020
They're not here yet, but...

00:13:38.020 --> 00:13:39.510
Wrong again.

00:13:39.610 --> 00:13:45.760
That seat is reserved for someone from Class 4 at our school.

00:13:46.280 --> 00:13:47.530
Isn't it strange?

00:13:47.530 --> 00:13:50.160
I thought you and I were the only ones from class 4

00:13:50.160 --> 00:13:52.980
who were taking the Izumizaka test.

00:13:53.640 --> 00:13:54.720
Who is it?

00:13:54.720 --> 00:13:58.440
It couldn't possibly be...
Toujou, could it?

00:13:59.090 --> 00:14:01.170
Tou... jou?

00:14:02.050 --> 00:14:03.070
No way.

00:14:03.070 --> 00:14:05.110
Maybe she fell in love with me

00:14:05.110 --> 00:14:07.970
and followed me here.

00:14:09.210 --> 00:14:11.520
Ah, you're so noble, Aya-chan...

00:14:12.930 --> 00:14:17.580
There's no way that'd happen!
Why would Toujou fall for <i>you?</i>

00:14:17.580 --> 00:14:21.320
I don't know, we just studied together.

00:14:21.320 --> 00:14:25.030
Maybe she started
liking me little by little.

00:14:25.030 --> 00:14:26.550
Don't be stupid.

00:14:26.550 --> 00:14:28.720
First of all, Toujou's ranked #1 in our school.

00:14:28.720 --> 00:14:30.700
Why would she take
the Izumizaka test?

00:14:31.300 --> 00:14:36.020
She'd have no trouble going for a much higher-ranked school.

00:14:36.020 --> 00:14:38.210
Well, that's true, but...

00:14:41.150 --> 00:14:46.130
But I wonder what'd happen if Toujou really showed up...

00:14:49.110 --> 00:14:52.520
Maybe that's because she has feelings for me...

00:14:54.310 --> 00:14:57.770
No, I'm probably just overthinking this.

00:14:58.610 --> 00:14:59.440
But--

00:15:05.820 --> 00:15:08.240
The test will begin momentarily.

00:15:08.670 --> 00:15:13.470
Please have only your pencils, erasers,
and test papers on your desk.

00:15:14.060 --> 00:15:16.330
She didn't come...

00:15:19.670 --> 00:15:21.770
Right now I gotta focus on the exam.

00:15:22.320 --> 00:15:23.480
You may begin!

00:15:27.730 --> 00:15:29.730
Manaka Junpei

00:15:30.800 --> 00:15:33.270
Sorry I'm late!

00:15:33.680 --> 00:15:37.640
Examinee #173, Toujou Aya.

00:15:38.230 --> 00:15:39.870
Hurry and take your seat.

00:15:39.870 --> 00:15:41.660
Ah! Aya-chan!

00:15:41.660 --> 00:15:43.720
Stay in your seat, boy!

00:15:44.480 --> 00:15:47.060
Everyone, please quiet down and continue with the test.

00:15:48.070 --> 00:15:51.110
T-That was Toujou...

00:15:52.580 --> 00:15:55.180
But, but...

00:15:55.180 --> 00:15:57.330
No matter how you look at it...

00:15:57.830 --> 00:16:00.520
She's not the Toujou I know.

00:16:01.960 --> 00:16:05.730
That is... the girl with the strawberry panties.

00:16:09.020 --> 00:16:11.080
What is going <i>on</i> here?

00:16:11.800 --> 00:16:14.970
The girl I fell for at first sight...

00:16:15.770 --> 00:16:18.910
That girl was actually... Toujou...

00:16:19.460 --> 00:16:22.180
And right now, that girl...

00:16:22.640 --> 00:16:25.190
...is sitting right behind me.

00:16:27.020 --> 00:16:29.860
I'm right in the middle of a test.
What am I thinking?

00:16:29.860 --> 00:16:34.340
It's just that Toujou has her glasses off and her hair down, right?

00:16:37.160 --> 00:16:39.470
Maybe it's too soon to tell.

00:16:39.470 --> 00:16:42.040
Was Toujou really the girl in strawberry panties?

00:16:42.460 --> 00:16:45.090
I mean, I only caught
a glimpse of them.

00:16:46.000 --> 00:16:48.510
If only I could look at her face.

00:16:49.090 --> 00:16:51.760
You there, eyes forward!

00:16:53.800 --> 00:16:57.390
What's wrong?
Are you not feeling well?

00:16:58.430 --> 00:17:02.190
No, I-I'm fine.

00:17:05.820 --> 00:17:09.070
